      "text": "ONE future application: Shao.OQ6.OriginalSameWitnessClippedEventTransport.actual_original_same_witness_clipped_event_transport μ h hh hh2 hhsymm hcenter hprojectionsecond p hp2 hp3 hgp cBudget hcBudget, with Ω and mΩ fixed at original theorem context. Complete result is the preceding245 head; choose only its full cg and m₀ existential, never an old243/244 existential. Every actual argument has the identical original binder type. hSZ remains ScalarShaoZhouFiniteCostTailInput.{u} cBudget C1 C2 C3 C4 and all four constants range over ℝ. No external input existence or fresh model application is proposed."
