      "text": "At fixed n,hn,C0,hC0,z,hz, the same245 real comparison holds every k. Its retained244 eventual scalar packet requires C1..C4,hSZ,hz1,hzWindow,τ,hτ. The strict joint packet requires hz1,hzWindow,τ,hτ and no external input; use exactly the same values. The respective complete existential Props, every selected cutoff, every signed order fact and all contexts are literal in the inventory. Combine cutoffs by the inline natural sum kTail+kJoint; natural arithmetic can use omega, real arithmetic linarith. No new helper theorem/API or assumption is needed. Logical projections/constructors and Classical.choose/choose_spec are the same existing mechanisms used in the frozen two model choices. No new named ordinary alias is licensed."
